People will, in fact, dance.
事实上，人们会跳舞。

00:59:14.679 --> 00:59:19.590
Real question, it just hit me.
真正的问题，它刚刚击中了我。

00:59:19.590 --> 00:59:25.079
Am I in love with you or just knew your city?
我是爱上你了还是只是了解你的城市？

00:59:25.079 --> 00:59:28.639
I remember in season one, we would have to drive somewhere else to sound mix the show.
我记得在第一季中，我们必须开车去其他地方为节目混音。

00:59:28.639 --> 00:59:33.480
And the guard letting me on was like, how I met your mother, that's that reality dating show, right?
让我上车的警卫说，我是怎么认识你妈妈的，那是那个真人秀相亲节目，对吧？

00:59:33.480 --> 00:59:34.480
Yeah.
是的。

00:59:34.480 --> 00:59:36.320
And I think I was like, yes, it is.
我想我当时想，是的，确实如此。

00:59:36.320 --> 00:59:38.679
Well, the first reaction was always, sorry, what about my mother?
嗯，第一反应总是，​​抱歉，我妈妈呢？

00:59:38.679 --> 00:59:40.679
Thank you so much.
太感谢了。

